<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net">
  <diagram name="System Design" id="system-design">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1750" pageHeight="2500" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0"/>
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0"/>
        <mxCell id="2" value="Design a Distributed Email Service (Gmail-like)" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;fontSize=18;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="20" width="600" height="40" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="frs" value="FUNCTIONAL REQUIREMENTS&#10;1. Send email to other users&#10;2. Users have their own inbox&#10;3. Receive emails into inbox&#10;4. Search through mails in inbox&#10;&#10;Out of scope: spam filtering" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fillColor=#dae8fc;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=8;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="80" width="360" height="160" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="nfrs" value="NON-FUNCTIONAL REQUIREMENTS&#10;1. HA 99.99% (~52 min/yr). Eventual consistency OK for mail&#10;2. Low-latency transfer: p99 &lt; 200ms&#10;3. Scale: 1B users, 200M DAU&#10;   - 5 sends/day, 3 reads/day x 20 emails/read&#10;   - Sends: ~11.5k/s avg, ~58k/s peak (5x)&#10;   - Reads: ~7k/s avg, ~35k/s peak (5x)&#10;4. Low-latency search: p99 &lt; 500ms&#10;&#10;Storage: 100KB/email -> 100 TB/day -> ~36 PB/yr" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=#82b366;fillColor=#d5e8d4;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=8;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="440" y="80" width="440" height="200" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="entities" value="CORE ENTITIES&#10;1. User (id, name, email)&#10;2. Email (id, from, subject, text, toList, ccList, bccList, createdAt)&#10;3. Inbox (id, userId)&#10;4. InboxEmailRecord (id, inboxId, emailId, createdAt)&#10;   - one Email, many InboxEmailRecords (per recipient)&#10;   - createdAt used to sort the inbox" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=#d6b656;fillColor=#fff2cc;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=8;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="320" width="560" height="150" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="api" value="API DESIGN  (identity from JWT auth header)&#10;&#10;1. POST /emails        [Idempotency-Key header]&#10;   Req:  { toList, ccList, bccList, subject, emailBody }&#10;   Res:  2xx { emailId }&#10;&#10;2. GET /emails?cursor={}&amp;limit={}&amp;query={}&#10;   Res:  { items: [ {id, from, toList, ccList, subject, createdAt, isRead} ],&#10;          nextCursor }&#10;   - cursor-based pagination, cursor = (createdAt, emailId)&#10;   - no emailBody in list view&#10;&#10;3. GET /emails/{id}&#10;   Res:  full Email incl. emailBody" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=#9673a6;fillColor=#e1d5e7;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=8;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="510" width="620" height="240" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="hldTitle" value="HIGH-LEVEL DESIGN  (Aayush's design)" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;fontSize=15;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="800" width="500" height="30" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="client" value="Client" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="870" width="130" height="60" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="apigw" value="API Gateway&#10;(auth)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="300" y="870" width="150" height="60" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lb" value="Load Balancer" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="580" y="870" width="150" height="60" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="mail" value="Mail Service&#10;(stateless,&#10;horizontally scaled)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="860" y="865" width="180" height="70" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="kafka" value="Kafka Queue&#10;(email msg, then&#10;per-recipient msgs)" style="shape=mxgraph.mscae.enterprise.event_hub;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="865" y="1080" width="170" height="70" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="dlq" value="DLQ&#10;(failed msgs)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1180" y="1085" width="140" height="60" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="worker" value="Idempotent Workers&#10;(write Email + fanout&#10;InboxEmailRecords)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="855" y="1300" width="190" height="70" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="cass" value="Cassandra&#10;(Email + emailBody,&#10;InboxEmailRecords&#10;partitioned by userId)" style="shape=cylinder3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;boundedLbl=1;backgroundOutline=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="870" y="1520" width="160" height="100" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="idx" value="Search Index&#10;(inverted indices on&#10;subject + emailBody)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1180" y="1535" width="180" height="70" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e1" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="client" target="apigw">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e2" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="apigw" target="lb">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e3" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="lb" target="mail">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e4" value="enqueue email msg" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="mail" target="kafka">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e5" value="consume" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="kafka" target="worker">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e6" value="re-enqueue per-recipient msgs" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="worker" target="kafka">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e7" value="failures" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="kafka" target="dlq">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e8" value="write Email + InboxEmailRecords" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="worker" target="cass">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e9" value="read: GET inbox / email (query by userId)" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;exitX=0.25;exitY=1;entryX=0.25;entryY=0;dashed=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="mail" target="cass">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e10" value="search query" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;dashed=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="mail" target="idx">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="optTitle" value="OPTIMAL HLD (Reference) — what a senior strong-hire would draw" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;fontSize=15;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#1a7f37;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="1740" width="700" height="30" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o_client" value="Client / MUA" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="1810" width="120" height="60" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o_gw" value="API Gateway&#10;(auth, rate limit)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="240" y="1810" width="140" height="60" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o_mail" value="Mail Service&#10;(stateless, behind LB)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="460" y="1810" width="160" height="60" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o_smtp" value="SMTP Gateway&#10;(MX lookup, external&#10;delivery w/ retry+backoff)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="720" y="1805" width="180" height="70" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o_kafka" value="Kafka&#10;(ingest + per-recipient&#10;fanout topic)" style="shape=mxgraph.mscae.enterprise.event_hub;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="470" y="1980" width="160" height="70" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o_dlq" value="DLQ" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="730" y="1985" width="110" height="60" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o_worker" value="Fanout Workers&#10;(idempotent,&#10;key=(userId,emailId))" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="450" y="2160" width="200" height="70" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o_meta" value="Metadata Store (Cassandra)&#10;InboxEmailRecord&#10;PK (userId, timeBucket), CK createdAt desc&#10;Email metadata, refs body in blob" style="shape=cylinder3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;boundedLbl=1;backgroundOutline=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="430" y="2340" width="230" height="100" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o_blob" value="Object Storage (S3/Blob)&#10;email bodies + attachments&#10;hot->cold tiering by age" style="shape=cylinder3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;boundedLbl=1;backgroundOutline=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="740" y="2340" width="210" height="100" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o_cdc" value="CDC (Debezium)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1030" y="2230" width="140" height="60" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o_es" value="Elasticsearch&#10;(per-user full-text index)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1030" y="2350" width="170" height="70" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="oe1" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="o_client" target="o_gw">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="oe2" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="o_gw" target="o_mail">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="oe3" value="write body" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.2;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="o_mail" target="o_blob">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="oe4" value="enqueue" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="o_mail" target="o_kafka">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="oe5" value="external mail" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="o_mail" target="o_smtp">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="oe6" value="consume" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="o_kafka" target="o_worker">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="oe7" value="poison" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="o_kafka" target="o_dlq">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="oe8" value="upsert InboxEmailRecord" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="o_worker" target="o_meta">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="oe9" value="read inbox (1 partition, newest-first)" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;exitX=0.25;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;dashed=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="o_mail" target="o_meta">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="oe10" value="change stream" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="o_meta" target="o_cdc">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="oe11" value="index" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="o_cdc" target="o_es">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="oe12" value="search (read)" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;exitX=1;exitY=0.75;entryX=0;entryY=0.25;dashed=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="o_mail" target="o_es">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o_tradeoffs" value="KEY TRADE-OFFS&#10;• Cassandra (metadata) vs Postgres: high write throughput + linear scale; give up multi-row ACID -> recovered via Kafka + idempotent upserts.&#10;• Object storage for bodies vs inline-in-Cassandra: keeps partitions small, enables hot/cold tiering at 36 PB/yr; give up a second hop + read join.&#10;• PK (userId, timeBucket) vs userId alone: bounds partition size, newest-first reads hit ONE partition; give up: cross-bucket scan for old mail / full-history queries.&#10;• Elasticsearch via CDC vs query Cassandra: real full-text + relevance; give up index lag (eventually consistent search) + extra infra/cost.&#10;• Kafka async fanout vs synchronous multi-write: durability + absorbs distribution-list bursts; give up read-your-writes immediacy (eventual inbox delivery)." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=#82b366;fillColor=#d5e8d4;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1250" y="1810" width="470" height="240" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o_deep" value="DEEP DIVES&#10;• Hard problem: durable, idempotent fanout. 1 email -> N InboxEmailRecords via Kafka; workers upsert with PK (userId,emailId) -> at-least-once is safe, no read-before-write.&#10;• Scale-break: 'partition by userId' grows unbounded for long-lived heavy users -> partition by (userId, timeBucket); inbox read walks newest bucket first.&#10;• Fanout amplification: send to a large alias/mailing list = write storm. Expand list async; cap fanout; consider shared-thread refs.&#10;• Consistency: eventual for inbox + search; sender 'Sent' folder written synchronously for read-your-writes.&#10;• Hot keys: viral/blasted recipient buckets -> sub-shard by hash within bucket if needed.&#10;• Operability: alert on Kafka consumer lag AND delivery lag = InboxEmailRecord.createdAt - Email.createdAt vs SLA; ES index lag; DLQ depth. Cost: tier old mail to cold storage." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=#9673a6;fillColor=#e1d5e7;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1250" y="2100" width="470" height="250" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
